[statement]
A required name left with a single candidate holds the names that candidate
would hold, before it is decided: `S`, which `base` needs, has `s1` alone,
which provides `K`, so `f1`, which provides `K` too, is passed over for `F`,
decided first.

[repository]
P:top
V:1
D:z base

P:base
V:1
D:S

P:z
V:1
D:F

P:f1
V:1
k:100
p:F K=1

P:f2
V:1
k:10
p:F

P:s1
V:1
p:S=1 K=1

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install f2 1
install z 1
install s1 1
install base 1
install top 1
